                        {"file": "README.md", "content": "# harbor\n\nA small static site generator. harbor turns a folder of Markdown pages into\nHTML using Go templates.\n\n```sh\nharbor build            # render changed pages in content/ into public/\nharbor build -force     # render every page\nharbor serve -addr :8080\n```\n\n## Layout\n\n- `content/` holds Markdown pages. A page's front matter sets its title and\n  template.\n- `templates/` holds the Go templates pages render with.\n- `public/` is the output. `public/.harbor-cache.json` records what each page\n  was built from, so builds skip unchanged pages.\n"}
